# API & auth

- `lib/api/coinzy.ts`: server-only guest client. Auth at `/auth/*`, data at `/api/*`. Separate guest tokens per `catalogue` vs `marketplace` backend.
- Prefer `unstable_cache` + tags for details when Bearer headers would bust `fetch` cache (`archetype-details`, `listing-details`, `marketplace-listings`).
- Normalize mixed string/number API fields in view-models — never call string methods on raw values.
- Browser auth: `lib/auth/client.ts` → `POST /api/auth/[action]` only. Proxy maps `docs/auth-api.md`, validates origin, strips tokens from JSON, sets HTTP-only cookies.
- Do not call guest-login per request (creates users). Do not re-enable Google without an explicit ask.
- Tests: `node tests/auth-api.cjs` after auth proxy changes.
